      "id": 20,
      "options": {
        "content": "<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 20px; background: #181b1f; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <div>\n    <h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: #f8fafc; font-size: 16px;\">\ud83d\udd17 1-Click Trace-to-Log Correlation & Distributed Tracing</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 13px;\">\n      Setiap log di bawah yang memuat <code>trace_id</code> memiliki tombol biru <b>TraceID</b>. Klik tombol tersebut untuk membuka waterfall span secara instan di Jaeger.<br/>\n      Untuk melihat visualisasi end-to-end W3C trace, buka <b>Jaeger UI</b> atau gunakan <b>Grafana Explore</b> dengan datasource <code>Jaeger</code>.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 10px;\">\n    <a href=\"http://localhost:16686\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; background: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;\">Open Jaeger UI \u2197</a>\n    <a href=\"/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22jaeger%22%7D\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; background: #1e293b; color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;\">Explore Traces in Grafana \u2197</a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "Trace Correlation Hub",
      "type": "text"
